<title>USA: Itawamba Cty, Miss., won by Morgan Keegan.</title>
<headline>Itawamba Cty, Miss., won by Morgan Keegan.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Keegan said it won $1.5 million of Itawamba Cty, Miss., general obligation public improvement bonds, Series 1996, with a net interest cost of 5.05 percent.</p>
